# Security & Licensing

Before adopting any MCP, skill, plugin, font, icon, or asset:

1. Verify publisher and official repository
2. Check LICENSE compatibility (commercial use if applicable)
3. Review permissions, telemetry, install scripts
4. Pin version or commit when installing
5. Register in `docs/tooling/AI_TOOL_SECURITY_REGISTRY.md` and `FREE_TIER_AND_LICENSE_REGISTRY.md`
6. No secrets in versioned files; use Cursor dashboard secrets for cloud
7. Figma Community: license per file — not assumed commercial
8. Do not evade paywalls or plan limits
9. Reject abandoned or unverified MCPs

Classification: `ADOPT_NOW` | `PREPARE` | `EVALUATE` | `REFERENCE_ONLY` | `REJECT`
